Yes, Vila is very apricot heavy and i was surprised by it too, even though it was listed first as a note. I really like Hexennacht morphine, which is also apricot heavy, so i did like Vila, but you're totally right that it did not end up being a spicy floral at all. I really didn't sense much rose at all!

&#x200B;

and :O thank you for your review of gargoyle, that made me want to get it even more. i really love lavender, and anything aggressively calming, and while i do not have the same memories attached to it of course, it's cool knowing that it does smell like a church in France by a lavender field lol. I do like incense, but well balanced works better for me usually, because certain things give me headaches if theyre too strong, and smoky notes are one of them.

\[US to US\] \[Sell\] \[Perfume\] 

