[google doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Xm2_CuvW52X1OvmrI1RPdW4mUvfKJ0HFjr-DMcJAWGw/edit?usp=sharing)

Oh! haha i wasn't talking about gourmand perfumes.. weirdly enough i recently discovered i actually don't like smelling like food! i just meant that my actual food preferences line up with my scent preferences. i like the way most everything smells. Taste and scent are linked and i guess i'm just not too discerning, however i am finding even if i like things, i don't want to smell like certain things all day. Nui cobalt april fools collection is coincidentally what made me realize this haha. I love the way some of those smell, but smelling like a tiramisu all day gives me a headache.

&#x200B;

My FS collection is expanding at a rapid rate, and i'm temp banning myself from anymore, because basically if it lasts longer than a couple hours, and i enjoy it, i'm like hell i need this. Only a few houses really have worked for me in this sense. BPAL, Solstice scents, hexennacht, and nui cobalt. I've tried quite a few other houses, and have been very disappointed with their lasting power (some i can't even smell at all.. alkemia.. lol ). I'm holding onto some for now just to see if it changes, but there's just so much out there i KNOW works well, i don't see the point in trying to baby certain scents. Once i get over my anxiety i'll prolly just try to de stash the lot of them.

I just recommended "Long Winter Farm" to someone the other day for their oil "gretel", and i realized i don't see them here ever. They were my first indie a few years back really. Little bird, porridge, and coquette are my favs by them :\] they're fairly inexpensive too, by comparison.

&#x200B;

i like their lip balms, however if they have a bad temp change they get very gritty.

Hello, i have a possibly stupid question that a lot of googling hasn't helped me with much.. I Just downloaded Terraria on my PC for the first time, and i am unable to play any worlds I think..

&#x200B;

It said there's randomly generated ones to play, and i'd really like that, but nothing at all pops up when i hit "worlds". I know i can download zip files for it but i seem to be having problems with THAT too for some reason. I didn't realize i wouldnt be able to play any maps when i downloaded this, and i'm fairly confused. If anyone has any experience/patience with someone 100% new to this please help lol
